Real application proof

npm run tauri dev built and launched the CEF application. The old subprocess implementation reproduced the startup pipe failure. After switching macOS to sysinfo, the actual sidebar displayed RAM 68% in the dark theme and RAM 67% in the light theme. Cmd+Q completed coordinated cleanup with global work registry empty and native WebView descendants=0.

Platform boundary

The pure Windows fallback parser and controlled Linux DRM sysfs parser execute on macOS tests. Cross-target cargo checks could not reach Beaver code because the local machine lacks the Windows SDK and Linux GTK sysroot; native Windows/Linux CI remains the authority for those platform-specific probes.
